OL,3,GNEWSALifeboat disaster behind famous
OL,4,Amotto remembered
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lifeboat disaster which killed nine
OL,7,Fcrewmen has been remembered on its
OL,8,F125th anniversary.
OL,10,FThe Beauchamp was attempting a rescue
OL,11,Foff Caister-on-Sea, Norfolk, during
OL,12,Fheavy rain and a gale when the sea
OL,13,Ftossed the boat back. It capsized by
OL,14,Fthe shore, trapping its 12 lifeboatmen
OL,15,Funderneath.
OL,17,FRetired coxswain James Haylett helped
OL,18,Fsave three crew and his testimony at an
OL,19,Finquest on the men's dogged persistence
OL,20,Fwas translated by journalists into
OL,21,F"Caister Men Never Turn Back", which is
OL,22,FCaister Lifeboat's motto.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
